  "about": "Shared vectors for the agent-reopen rule: packages/chat (TypeScript), blerg-runner (Python) and runner/internal/server (Go) all test against this file. text: a reason is valid when it has at most 2000 code points and something is left after removing Unicode Cc, Cf and Z characters (repeat: the text repeated that many times). revision: the JSON literal of a revision; valid when it is a number with an integral value from 1 to 1000000. applies: a person's thread and the agent's copy, as JSON; whether the agent's reopen applies. Cn (unassigned) characters count as invisible too, so a writer on older Unicode tables is never more lenient than a reader on newer ones. parse: one request of a review file; whether a reader accepts the file (the browser and blerg-runner).",
